atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bd45d23c09f826c942a3e3770c23fac2.avif?t=1785520839\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Souls-Like Western full of Eldritch horrors. Explore the accursed Wild West town of Tombwater and lay bare the darkness that lies beneath. Survive blood-spilling combat in this gruesome 2D action-RPG that may just drive you to madness.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Every single aspect feels original, highly polished, and extremely satisfying to play.”<br>95/100 – VDGMS <br><br>“It’s a Soulslike. It’s a Metroidvania. And it’s even a Zelda-like, all without compromising on its bleak wild west atmosphere. Tombwater is one of my favorite Soulslikes, if not one of my favorite games, period. I could barely put this one down.”<br>89/100 – Cog Connected  <br><br>“A wonderfully-designed adventure that caters for all players thanks to accessibility options, it shines because of its excellent visuals, puzzles, exploration and rich combat. It’s undoubtedly a highlight of the year so far, and it deserves its moment in the spotlight.”<br>9/10 – Gamespew<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/header.jpg?t=1785520839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/9e5632ffb7f3ce57b99221ce2c76f8eaec9d5058/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785520839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/9e5632ffb7f3ce57b99221ce2c76f8eaec9d5058/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785520839", "website": "https://www.midwestgames.com/game/tombwater", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong